# Public-source allowlist
#
# This repository is developed beside large local archives and account-derived runtime
# data. Ignore everything by default and explicitly admit only the files required to
# understand, run, test, and reproduce the application. New source categories must be
# reviewed and added deliberately.
*

# Repository entry points
!.gitignore
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!LICENSE
!requirements-dev.txt
!requirements.txt
!server.py

# Application modules
!discovery/
discovery/*
!discovery/*.py

# Browser application (the build regenerates static/app.ico)
!static/
static/*
!static/*.html
!static/*.js
!static/*.css

# Reproducible launch/build utilities
!scripts/
scripts/*
!scripts/*.py
!scripts/*.ps1

# Existing standalone validation suite
!tests/
tests/*
!tests/*.py

# Current behavioral documentation only. Historical audits and release notes remain local.
!docs/
docs/*
!docs/content-controls.md
